{"about_the_game":"Survivor is a first-person 3D adventure game originally made for the ARS17 exhibition in Kiasma Museum of Contemporary Art, Helsinki.  Survivor takes place in an empty museum where you are put into a tribe of ten and told to vote each other out one by one until there is only one left. Your goal is to be that sole survivor. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nConcept, art, and writing: Reija Meril\u00e4inen<br />\r\nProgramming: Santeri R\u00e4is\u00e4nen<br />\r\n3D stuff: Eetu Sihvonen &amp; Reija Meril\u00e4inen<br />\r\nSound design: Eero Pulkkinen<br />\r\nMusic: Aukra<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCONTROLS:<br />\r\nMoving around:   WASD + mouselook / arrow keys + mouselook <br />\r\n(run with shift down)<br />\r\nSelect:   Space / Enter<br />\r\nSkip dialogue:   Space / Enter<br />\r\nQuit game:   Esc","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1031700?t=1555938033","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1031700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1555938033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1031700/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1555938033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1031700/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1555938033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Survivor is a first-person 3D adventure game originally made for the ARS17 exhibition in Kiasma Museum of Contemporary Art, Helsinki.  Survivor takes place in an empty museum where you are put into a tribe of ten and told to vote each other out one by one until there is only one left. Your goal is to be that sole survivor. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nConcept, art, and writing: Reija Meril\u00e4inen<br />\r\nProgramming: Santeri R\u00e4is\u00e4nen<br />\r\n3D stuff: Eetu Sihvonen &amp; Reija Meril\u00e4inen<br />\r\nSound design: Eero Pulkkinen<br />\r\nMusic: Aukra<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCO